a/">Wat Sena Nuch Rangsan</a></p><a class="text-link" href="/en/traditions/chak-phra/">Read details from document ↗</a></div></details><details class="tradition"><summary><span class="event-no">07</span><span class="event-name">Loy Krathong</span><span class="event-period">Full moon of the 12th Thai lunar month · Document mentions November</span><span class="expand-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="event-body"><p>Related places: <a href="/en/places/riverwalk/">Takuapa Riverwalk</a></p><a class="text-link" href="/en/traditions/loy-krathong/">Read details from document ↗</a></div></details></div><p class="small">Check each year’s schedule before travelling</p></section><section class="food-feature"><div class="food-feature-image"><img src="/assets/food-center.webp" alt="ศูนย์อาหารลานโล่งตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="food-stamp">LOCAL<br>FLAVOURS</span></div><div class="food-feature-copy"><span class="chapter">05 / Eat and shop for souvenirs in the district</span><h2>Know the city<br>Through another flavor</h2><p>Open the list of restaurants, drinks, and souvenirs<br>59 shops from municipal brochure</p><div class="food-counts"><span><b>32</b>Food</span><span><b>20</b>Drinks</span><span><b>08</b>Souvenirs</span></div><a class="button" href="/en/eat/">Find shops<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section><section class="about-strip"><span class="chapter">Notes from Baan Siwara</span><h2>The town’s story<br>That we want to invite you to know</h2><div><p>Takua Pa 101 compiles information from the Takua Pa municipal brochure, with sources and data scope for you to read further</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/about/">Get to know this guide ↗</a></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="footer-top"><a href="/en/" class="footer-name">Takua Pa <em>101</em></a><p>One city<br>Stories to get to know</p><a class="round-link" href="#main" aria-label="กลับขึ้นด้านบน">↑</a></div><div class="footer