utton" href="/en/trip/" aria-label="ทริปของคุณ"><span class="ib-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◫</span><span class="qs-badge" data-trip-count hidden>0</span></a><a class="header-map" href="/en/map/">Open map ↗</a></div></header><main id="main"><div class="intro"><a class="eyebrow" href="/en/">Takua Pa 101 / Old Town Guide</a><h1>Choose to open the city's stories</h1><p class="lead">20 destinations · Temples, shrines, old buildings, and street life</p></div><div class="explorer" data-explorer><div class="explorer-tools"><label class="search-label">Search places<input type="search" data-place-search placeholder="ชื่อวัด ศาลเจ้า หรือจุดที่อยากไป" autocomplete="off"></label><div class="filter-tabs" role="group" aria-label="หมวดสถานที่"><button type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All <sup>20</sup></button><button type="button" data-filter="temple" aria-pressed="false">Temples & Pagodas <sup>6</sup></button><button type="button" data-filter="shrine" aria-pressed="false">Shrines & Vegetarian Halls <sup>4</sup></button><button type="button" data-filter="heritage" aria-pressed="false">Old Buildings & City Traces <sup>4</sup></button><button type="button" data-filter="park" aria-pressed="false">Parks & Public Spaces <sup>2</sup></button><button type="button" data-filter="market" aria-pressed="false">Markets & Food <sup>3</sup></button><button type="button" data-filter="museum" aria-pressed="false">Museums <sup>1</sup></button></div></div><div class="explorer-status"><span data-place-count role="status" aria-live="polite">20 places to slowly get to know</span><span>Select image to read ↗</span></div><h2 class="visually-hidden">รายชื่อสถานที่ทั้งหมด</h2><div class="places-grid"><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="temple" data-name="วัดบรมธาตุคีรีเขต (วัดลุ่ม)"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/wat-boromthat/"><img src="/assets/wat-boromthat.webp" alt="วัดบรมธาตุคีรีเขต (วัดลุ่ม)" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">01</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-boromthat/">Wat Boromthat Khiri Khet (the town's relic temple)</a></h3><p>White pagoda and the town's faith</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="temple" data-name="วัดคุหาภิมุข (วัดควนถ้ำ)"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/wat-khuha/"><img src="/assets/wat-khuha.webp" alt="วัดคุหาภิมุข (วัดควนถ้ำ)" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">02</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-khuha/">Wat Khuha Phimuk (the cave hill temple)</a></h3><p>Small details that invite you to pause and look.</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="temple" data-name="วัดปทุมธารา (วัดหน้าเมือง)"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/wat-pathum/"><img src="/assets/wat-pathum.webp" alt="วัดปทุมธารา (วัดหน้าเมือง)" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">03</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-pathum/">Wat Pathum Thara (the front town temple)</a></h3><p>Old ordination hall and waterway stories</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="temple" data-name="วัดคงคาภิมุข (วัดคงคา)"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/wat-kongkha/"><img src="/assets/wat-kongkha.webp" alt="วัดคงคาภิมุข (วัดคงคา)" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">04</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-kongkha/">Wat Kongkha Phimuk (the riverside temple)</a></h3><p>Southern Thai style ordination hall details</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="temple" data-name="วัดนิกรวราราม (วัดย่านยาว)"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/wat-nikorn/"><img src="/assets/wat-nikorn.webp" alt="วัดนิกรวราราม (วัดย่านยาว)" width="1000" height="726" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">05</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-nikorn/">Wat Nikornwararam</a></h3><p>The temple and community memories</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="temple" data-name="วัดเสนานุชรังสรรค์ (วัดใหม่)"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/wat-sena/"><img src="/assets/wat-sena.webp" alt="วัดเสนานุชรังสรรค์ (วัดใหม่)" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">06</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Temples & Pagodas</span><h3><a href="/en/places/wat-sena/">Wat Sena Nuch Rangsan</a></h3><p>Thai and Chinese traces in the same building</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="shrine" data-name="ศาลเจ้าพ่อกวนอู ซิ่นไช่ตึ๋ง"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/guan-yu/"><img src="/assets/guan-yu.webp" alt="ศาลเจ้าพ่อกวนอู ซิ่นไช่ตึ๋ง" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">08</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Shrines & Vegetarian Halls</span><h3><a href="/en/places/guan-yu/">Guan Yu / Sin Chai Tung Shrine</a></h3><p>Red door and the community's faith</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="shrine" data-name="ศาลเจ้าปุนเถ่ากงอ๊า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/pun-thao/"><img src="/assets/pun-thao.webp" alt="ศาลเจ้าปุนเถ่ากงอ๊า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">09</span><span class=