governor-wall/"><img src="/assets/governor-wall.webp" alt="กำแพงจวนเจ้าเมืองตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">17</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Old Buildings & City Traces</span><h3><a href="/en/places/governor-wall/">Governor’s Residence Wall</a></h3><p>A trace on the wall that tells the town's story</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="heritage" data-name="บ้านขุนอินทร์"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/khun-in/"><img src="/assets/khun-in.webp" alt="บ้านขุนอินทร์" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">18</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Old Buildings & City Traces</span><h3><a href="/en/places/khun-in/">Khun In House</a></h3><p>Windows and balconies inviting a look into the past</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="heritage" data-name="โรงเรียนเต้าหมิง"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/tao-ming/"><img src="/assets/tao-ming.webp" alt="โรงเรียนเต้าหมิง" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">19</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Old Buildings & City Traces</span><h3><a href="/en/places/tao-ming/">Tao Ming School</a></h3><p>A building that passes on language and culture</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="park" data-name="สวนสาธารณะพระนารายณ์"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/phra-narai/"><img src="/assets/phra-narai.webp" alt="สวนสาธารณะพระนารายณ์" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">12</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Parks & Public Spaces</span><h3><a href="/en/places/phra-narai/">Phra Narai Park</a